  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Sets the score of the player at $cc28+X to five spaces and a 0. X = 9 for player 1, $19 for player 2."},
    {"at":23,"placement":"line","text":"Compares the six score digits of both players. Returns X = 0 when player 1 is higher, 1 when player 2 is higher, $80 when equal. Called by game_two_players."},
    {"at":54,"placement":"line","text":"Lone RTS. Called with the winner in X after a decision by time or by score. It is the place of a removed winner action."},
    {"at":55,"placement":"line","text":"Copies the score of the player in X to the high score of the mode when it is higher. Called at the end of a game."},
    {"at":118,"placement":"line","text":"Compares the high score at text_dest_ptr with the score at $cc28+X. Returns C clear when the score is higher. Called by high_score_update."},
    {"at":139,"placement":"line","text":"Copies the six score digits at $cc28+X to the high score at text_dest_ptr. Called by high_score_update."},
    {"at":153,"placement":"line","text":"Adds move_score_values of scoring_move times 100 to the player at $cc28+X, half of it for a half point. X = 9 or $19."},
    {"at":173,"placement":"side","text":"A half point gives half the value."},
    {"at":182,"placement":"side","text":"The first points change the tens digit from space to 0."},
    {"at":194,"placement":"line","text":"Adds 100 points to the score at $cc28+X: increments the hundreds digit with carry. A space digit becomes 1. Called by score_add_move, time_bonus_count and the bull test."},
    {"at":301,"placement":"side","text":"Above 999900 the score becomes 000000."},
    {"at":322,"placement":"line","text":"Shows the high score of the current mode at $ccb1. Called by the title loop, the F3 key and the end of the one-player game."},
    {"at":348,"placement":"line","text":"Counts one frame of the bout clock. Each 50 frames it decrements the digits at $cc3b and timer_seconds; at 0 it sets time_up. Called by bout_loop and time_bonus_count."},
    {"at":381,"placement":"side","text":"From 10 to 9: the tens digit becomes a space."}
  ],
